# Everything the image does not need. A smaller context is a faster build and a
# smaller attack surface.
.git
.github
*.md
Makefile
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.env
.env.*
coverage.out
bin/

# NOTE: unlike the other Arcadia services, this file does *not* exclude
# `**/*_test.go`. The Dockerfile runs `go test ./...` inside the build stage, and
# excluding the test files would make that step pass with zero tests — a green
# build that proved nothing. If the test step is ever removed from the Dockerfile,
# add the exclusion back.
